            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>For the most part aged over 50, people affected with osteoarthritis frequently present associated comorbidities. Debilitating and detrimental in terms of quality of life and fitness to work, osteoarthritis is becoming a public health issue which must be considered in terms of prevention, management and research.</AbstractText>
